{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The end of the universe. Humanity has disappeared, and the stars have gone out. However, humanity was able to leave something behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The World of Ideas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everything is relative in this world, and in the great void, ideas begin to materialize. As one of the self-aware ideas, you strive for the ultimate materialization of the world of ideas, but the battle for it will not be easy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345740/extras/SteamGif3F1ix.gif?t=1742288153\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rogue Tactics is a turn-based tactical roguelike inspired by games like Kings Bounty and Into the Breach. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect a unique squad of creatures with their own strengths and weaknesses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight in deep tactical battles with the impact of landscape on combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine creatures to create stronger ones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect a variety of spells that can turn the tide of battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find &quot;Ideas&quot; with their unique effects.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345740/extras/SteamGif2.gif?t=1742288153\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Replayability - procedural generation and a vast amount of content  make each run unique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lots of unlockable content.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2345740?t=1742288153","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2345740?t=1742288153","capsule_ima